# Backend secrets — FRESH VALUES, generated for the repository.
#
# These are NOT the secrets guarding any existing deployment's data. They were
# generated specifically so a clone of this repo is deployable out of the box.
# Every value below is a working 32-byte secret; none of them has ever encrypted
# anything.
#
# If you are standing up a NEW deployment you can use this file as-is. If you
# are joining an EXISTING one you must obtain its real values out of band —
# MEDIA_KEK in particular is not recoverable, and a mismatched one makes every
# sealed media blob permanently unreadable.
#
# Regenerate at any time with ../gen-secrets.sh.

# --- The seven preflight-gated secrets. 32 bytes each, base64. --------------
